  "interpretation": [
    "HB126 specifies one M255 cross shaft with ten splines and two M269 high-speed drums with ten splines and 15-inch diameter.",
    "SNL252/253 confirms one cross shaft and two each drum-half case, plain-half case and high-speed drum. SNL80 quantity two large planet disks.",
    "Plate22 is a horizontal section: image horizontal follows transverse shaft, image down is tank forward. Plate23 is an end section, pinion to tank front at image left.",
    "M263 rear case and M264 front cover are longitudinal halves, not transverse duplicate side caps. Plate23 top/bottom joint and rear mounting feet guide this inference.",
    "Plate23 HB legend prints M255 at both18 and19, while19 appears to point to wheel; do not treat this as a second cross shaft."
  ],
